efin Tuna Crispy Rice</span><span style=\"font-weight:900; font-size:15.5px; color:#dc2626;\">$19</span></div><div style=\"font-size:11.5px; color:#cbd5e1; margin-top:3px; line-height:1.35;\">Pan-seared sushi rice cubes topped with line-caught spicy bluefin tartare, serrano chili & yuzu kosho</div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:13px;\"><div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline; border-bottom:1px dotted #d4af37; padding-bottom:3px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:800; font-size:14.5px; color:#f4f4f6; letter-spacing:0.3px;\">Sakura Blossom King Salmon Roll</span><span style=\"font-weight:900; font-size:15.5px; color:#dc2626;\">$21</span></div><div style=\"font-size:11.5px; color:#cbd5e1; margin-top:3px; line-height:1.35;\">Ora King salmon, snow crab, mango, wrapped in pink soy paper with yuzu-miso glaze</div></div></div>",
